01:01:57.480 --> 01:01:59.013
Whoa. God, God, God.

01:02:00.966 --> 01:02:03.070
- My legs just gave up there for a second.

01:02:03.070 --> 01:02:04.704
Take it nice and slow.

01:02:04.704 --> 01:02:07.371
(Garnt singing)

01:02:08.248 --> 01:02:10.489
(Joey and Connor sing)

01:02:10.489 --> 01:02:12.030
- I can't even talk anymore.

01:02:12.030 --> 01:02:13.290
(Connor burps)

01:02:13.290 --> 01:02:18.230
Slow down. No need to worry.
No, no, no, no. I insist.

01:02:18.230 --> 01:02:19.363
- I'll do it myself.

01:02:20.300 --> 01:02:22.980
- Going over the bumps hurts so much.

01:02:22.980 --> 01:02:23.979
- Ow.

01:02:23.979 --> 01:02:24.934
- Ow.

01:02:24.934 --> 01:02:25.973
- Ow.

01:02:26.880 --> 01:02:28.930
- Any bumps. Right?

01:02:28.930 --> 01:02:30.740
- I think just like the sheer willpower

01:02:30.740 --> 01:02:33.050
has just like numbed my legs and butt.

01:02:33.050 --> 01:02:33.883
- [Garnt] Yeah,

01:02:33.883 --> 01:02:35.240
- And I just don't feel anything anymore.

01:02:35.240 --> 01:02:38.340
- I feel like this day may
have given me a permanent fear

01:02:38.340 --> 01:02:41.660
of hills and just slight inclines.

01:02:41.660 --> 01:02:44.010
- Is there another fucking bridge?

01:02:44.010 --> 01:02:44.850
- I think so.

01:02:44.850 --> 01:02:47.510
- Oh my God. No way.

01:02:47.510 --> 01:02:48.940
- Why am I here?

01:02:48.940 --> 01:02:51.543
Just to suffer, just to fucking cry,

01:02:53.683 --> 01:02:54.783
that ain't right, man.

01:02:55.709 --> 01:02:56.542
That ain't right.

01:02:56.542 --> 01:02:58.460
- Oh my God. The moment my ass

01:02:58.460 --> 01:03:02.320
lifts off the chair is like
the most excruciating pain

01:03:02.320 --> 01:03:05.410
- Just plant in that man, don't move it.

01:03:05.410 --> 01:03:07.220
- Where's the stop point.

01:03:07.220 --> 01:03:09.677
Tell me so I can stop this last time

01:03:09.677 --> 01:03:11.732
and I'll never start again.

01:03:11.732 --> 01:03:13.780
(Garnt groans)

01:03:13.780 --> 01:03:14.613
- Fuck.

01:03:14.613 --> 01:03:17.260
- Thank you for warning me
Garnt. Now I know that's there.

01:03:17.260 --> 01:03:20.530
- Pretty dark. I can barely see anything.

01:03:20.530 --> 01:03:22.100
The lights, they do nothing.

01:03:22.100 --> 01:03:24.540
- And I'm sure their
GoPros can only see my face

01:03:24.540 --> 01:03:28.990
but it is very dark.
Wow. That got dark fast.

01:03:28.990 --> 01:03:30.920
- Cycling tunnel to the left.

01:03:30.920 --> 01:03:32.453
- I see the finish line.

01:03:34.250 --> 01:03:35.233
- Look at that.

01:03:35.233 --> 01:03:37.493
Look at how beautiful that looks.

01:03:37.493 --> 01:03:40.330
(Joey joyfully shouts)

01:03:40.330 --> 01:03:41.963
Let's go.

01:03:41.963 --> 01:03:45.000
- Oh my God, I'm in such pain.

01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:46.720
I've got fucking arthritis for sure bro.

01:03:46.720 --> 01:03:47.600
- Fuck yeah, boys.

01:03:47.600 --> 01:03:49.979
- Going on the site, it was so good.

01:03:49.979 --> 01:03:52.088
- Oh fucking hell Garnt, you've
got shit all over your hand.

01:03:52.088 --> 01:03:52.921
(Garnt laughs)

01:03:52.921 --> 01:03:55.170
All right. We're finally,
finally fucking done.

01:03:55.170 --> 01:03:57.025
- Game is we are done.

01:03:57.025 --> 01:03:58.380
- That bridge was so long.

01:03:58.380 --> 01:04:03.380
- I am broken physically,
mentally, spiritually.

01:04:03.560 --> 01:04:05.360
- My ligaments are probably broken.

01:04:05.360 --> 01:04:07.010
- You know like every
anime when they get punched

01:04:07.010 --> 01:04:08.770
hard enough, they cough up blood?

01:04:08.770 --> 01:04:10.424
I feel like I just want to do

01:04:10.424 --> 01:04:11.360
(Joey coughs)

01:04:11.360 --> 01:04:12.870
Just cough up blood every second.

01:04:12.870 --> 01:04:14.208
I'm on the fucking hill like

01:04:14.208 --> 01:04:15.290
(Connor coughs)

01:04:15.290 --> 01:04:17.810
but I got to keep fighting
for the Leaf village.

01:04:17.810 --> 01:04:20.480
- But this is the cycling terminal

01:04:20.480 --> 01:04:23.080
which means that we Trash Taste Boys

01:04:23.080 --> 01:04:26.500
have officially completed
the Shimanami Kaido trail.

01:04:26.500 --> 01:04:31.410
I like attempted to muster
up some happy feelings there.

01:04:31.410 --> 01:04:32.249
I was like

01:04:32.249 --> 01:04:33.950
- You know I mean, I wouldn't be happy too

01:04:33.950 --> 01:04:35.759
if I didn't do it all. You know?

01:04:35.759 --> 01:04:37.501
I mean, I'm just saying, if I cheated.

01:04:37.501 --> 01:04:39.900
- Someone went on a ferry

01:04:39.900 --> 01:04:42.920
- Not my fucking choice, I had to go.

01:04:42.920 --> 01:04:44.032
You fucking say that.

01:04:44.032 --> 01:04:46.990
- You must blame the
Gacha gods for that one.

01:04:46.990 --> 01:04:49.990
- It was kind of your fault
that you have to go ferry.

01:04:49.990 --> 01:04:51.960
- Yeah. You're the one
that popped the tire.

01:04:51.960 --> 01:04:53.477
- We're never going to
hear the end of this.

01:04:53.477 --> 01:04:55.270
- And we'll cut back to
the studio now anyway.

01:04:55.270 --> 01:04:56.103
Yeah. All right.

01:04:56.103 --> 01:04:58.310
So we'll cut to when we're not dead.

01:04:58.310 --> 01:04:59.469
Yeah. All right?

01:04:59.469 --> 01:05:00.380
- [All] Bye.

01:05:00.380 --> 01:05:02.100
- Boys I have to ask one question.

01:05:02.100 --> 01:05:05.530
How does it feel to be a
cheater? A dirty little cheater?

01:05:05.530 --> 01:05:09.930
- I feel good. I feel great.
Actually, I feel shit.

01:05:09.930 --> 01:05:12.960
That was the hardest
challenge I've done in my life

01:05:12.960 --> 01:05:13.793
probably.

01:05:13.793 --> 01:05:15.040
- Can we please make the next one

01:05:15.040 --> 01:05:17.050
