01:05:18.650 --> 01:05:20.070
- No. I really don't.

01:05:20.070 --> 01:05:22.950
- I thought it was okay
suffering as a thought,

01:05:22.950 --> 01:05:24.620
but then I did it and halfway through,

01:05:24.620 --> 01:05:27.370
I wanted to end my life. I
want it to be it to be over.

01:05:27.370 --> 01:05:29.460
I was fine cheating. And you know what?

01:05:29.460 --> 01:05:31.810
I, you know, I was going
back looking through it.

01:05:31.810 --> 01:05:35.270
I think we kind of cycled
around the same distance.

01:05:35.270 --> 01:05:36.323
So that makes me feel all right.

01:05:36.323 --> 01:05:38.030
- Yeah we leveled the playing field.

01:05:38.030 --> 01:05:38.985
- I had no choice.

01:05:38.985 --> 01:05:39.990
(everyone laughs)

01:05:39.990 --> 01:05:43.340
You guys chose to ruin
the sanctity of our race.

01:05:43.340 --> 01:05:44.190
I couldn't believe it.

01:05:44.190 --> 01:05:45.850
I actually ran the numbers boys,

01:05:45.850 --> 01:05:46.683
because I was that determined

01:05:46.683 --> 01:05:48.470
