the footage to check.

01:05:48.470 --> 01:05:51.280
Turns out, even if I
didn't break for 30 minutes

01:05:51.280 --> 01:05:52.370
and you still cheated,

01:05:52.370 --> 01:05:54.420
I actually still would
have beat you on the time.

01:05:54.420 --> 01:05:55.537
- You were that desperate for a W?

01:05:55.537 --> 01:05:58.249
- That's how desperate I was for a w

01:05:58.249 --> 01:06:00.498
- Why would you assume
there was any sanctity.

01:06:00.498 --> 01:06:02.010
(all laughing)

01:06:02.010 --> 01:06:03.020
This is Trash Taste.

01:06:03.020 --> 01:06:05.640
- I won't forget this
on the next special boy.

01:06:05.640 --> 01:06:07.173
