01:06:12.158 --> 01:06:12.991
(Joey laughs)

01:06:12.991 --> 01:06:13.824
- But yeah.

01:06:13.824 --> 01:06:15.283
How would you boys feel about
completing the challenge?

01:06:15.283 --> 01:06:19.770
I mean, I feel like, you
know, I skipped a fair bit

01:06:19.770 --> 01:06:21.660
but I still feel happy
that I actually did it.

01:06:21.660 --> 01:06:23.810
- Yeah. It feels good
being the real winner.

01:06:23.810 --> 01:06:25.220
You know, that's what I want to say.

01:06:25.220 --> 01:06:28.023
- Finally, become the winner
of a Trash Taste Special.

01:06:29.310 --> 01:06:31.740
