more than a single day.

01:06:39.020 --> 01:06:40.670
I want to spread out over multiple days.

01:06:40.670 --> 01:06:41.740
- Oh no, it's fine. Come on.

01:06:41.740 --> 01:06:43.480
- No, it's not fine. It's not.

01:06:43.480 --> 01:06:44.830
- It's fine. It's fine. If
you can do that in one day.

01:06:44.830 --> 01:06:47.780
- You know I want to do, actually
I want to go on the ferry.

01:06:47.780 --> 01:06:49.350
- Like we never figured
out what it was like

01:06:49.350 --> 01:06:50.183
