the entire time. I'm salty.

01:06:56.185 --> 01:06:57.560
Where's our beach episode.

01:06:57.560 --> 01:06:58.400
- That's our next special

01:06:58.400 --> 01:06:59.500
- that's our next special the beach.

01:06:59.500 --> 01:07:00.620
There's no challenge.

01:07:00.620 --> 01:07:03.509
Just the beach episodes, but yes.

01:07:03.509 --> 01:07:05.231
- I bet Chris would come to that one.

01:07:05.231 --> 01:07:06.640
- Yeah definitely.

01:07:06.640 --> 01:07:08.860
- Yeah. I want to give a quick
shout out to our Patreons

01:07:08.860 --> 01:07:11.050
