film than a drifting episode.

01:07:18.500 --> 01:07:19.333
Wasn't it?

01:07:19.333 --> 01:07:21.370
- Yeah. Well, when you're
spanning over a hundred kilometers

01:07:21.370 --> 01:07:23.880
