01:07:48.500 --> 01:07:51.232
So thank you very much.
Fuck you but thank you.

01:07:51.232 --> 01:07:52.760
(Connor laughs)

01:07:52.760 --> 01:07:54.680
- And there are definitely more specials

01:07:54.680 --> 01:07:55.730
and challenges to come.

01:07:55.730 --> 01:07:58.090
So hopefully you guys
stick around as well.

01:07:58.090 --> 01:07:59.530
- So I guess we'll see you guys soon

01:07:59.530 --> 01:08:01.210
